      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'This is the Knight class, also known as the Light class.


    The Light
    class is built for players who want to move fast, reposition quickly, and deal
    critical-based damage. They excel at traversing the map and surviving dangerous
    falls.

    

    Q - Grapple Hook: Fires a grappling hook up to 50 units away
    that rapidly pulls you toward the target. Excellent for engaging, escaping, or
    swinging around the map (3s cooldown).

    R - Rescue Dash: A potent mid-air
    dash specifically designed to save you from death. It can only be activated when
    you are falling at high speeds, giving you a sudden burst of momentum to get
    back on the map (5s cooldown). '
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5c7a92cce04a5ee478f36d2f5b537e05, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 97671534423474389, guid: 5c7a92cce04a5ee478f36d2f5b537e05, type: 2}
