  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5caa29abdd73d9b45a249860a6767ec7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CharacterHoverInfo
  description: 'This is the Heavy class, also known as the Tank class.


    The
    Tank is a slow, methodical powerhouse designed to protect the team, control space,
    and crush weaker enemies under their immense weight.

    

    Q - Shield
    Bubble: Deploys a massive protective dome (8-unit radius) around the Tank for
    7.5 seconds. Teammates can hide inside this bubble to avoid damage (30s cooldown).

    R
    - Heavy Slam: A devastating ground pound. It instantly executes any "light" enemies
    (under 100 max HP) caught in the radius, and applies massive knockback to heavy
    enemies and Bosses (6s cooldown).

    Passive (Heavy Armor): The Tank actually
    has two separate health bars (Shield HP + Normal HP), with the shield taking
    damage first. However, due to their weight, wall bounces are highly punishing
    and will significantly reduce your momentum upon collision.'
  infoPanel: {fileID: 831816450}
  infoText: {fileID: 73351416}
  padding: {x: 40, y: 40}
