  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5caa29abdd73d9b45a249860a6767ec7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CharacterHoverInfo
  description: 'This is the Knight class, also known as the Light class.


    The
    Light class is built for players who want to move fast, reposition quickly, and
    deal critical-based damage. They excel at traversing the map and surviving dangerous
    falls.

    

    Q - Grapple Hook: Fires a grappling hook up to 50 units away
    that rapidly pulls you toward the target. Excellent for engaging, escaping, or
    swinging around the map (3s cooldown).

    R - Rescue Dash: A potent mid-air
    dash specifically designed to save you from death. It can only be activated when
    you are falling at high speeds, giving you a sudden burst of momentum to get
    back on the map (5s cooldown). '
  infoPanel: {fileID: 813950134}
  infoText: {fileID: 73351416}
  padding: {x: 40, y: 40}
