--- !u!114 &1822153702
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1822153700}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'This is the Healer class, also known as the Medium class.


    The Healer
    is the backbone of the team, built around sustaining teammates and building up
    a massive "Uber" charge to unleash game-changing ultimate abilities.

    

    Q
    (Hold) - Heal Beam: Locks onto the nearest ally and continuously heals them over
    time. While healing, your Uber meter rapidly fills up.

    R - AOE Heal Burst:
    Instantly triggers a healing burst that restores health to all allies within
    a 12-unit radius around you (10s cooldown).

    F - Activate Uber: Once your
    Uber meter reaches 100, you can activate this ultimate. The Healer can uniquely
    toggle between two Uber modes:

    Immortal Mode: Grants absolute invulnerability
    for 10 seconds.

    Teleport Mode: Allows you to instantly teleport an ally
    from up to 100 units away directly to your location.

    Passive: The Healer
    inherently triggers health-regeneration logic when scoring enemy kills.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5c7a92cce04a5ee478f36d2f5b537e05, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 97671534423474389, guid: 5c7a92cce04a5ee478f36d2f5b537e05, type: 2}
